## Deployment Instructions

### Hugging Face Spaces

1. Create new Space on Hugging Face
2. Choose SDK: Streamlit
3. Connect GitHub repository: `jacopo-monti/portfolio-rebalancer`
4. Select branch: `repository-reorganization-for-huggingfaces`
5. Wait for automatic build (2-5 minutes)
6. Access deployed app at Space URL

### Local Testing

```bash
# Verify installation
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Run web app
streamlit run app.py

# Should open at http://localhost:7860

# Run tests
pytest

# All tests should pass
```

